  Expected:
    status: unimplemented_engine_shape
    reason: IA frame-limited-robustness shape outside the rule-numbered IA verifier inventory (the IA dischargers serve numbered IA suffixes only). The authoritative machine-check is the compiled Lean AimsProof.ContractBoundary (lake build clean): T5_frame_untouched_class_ledger_verbatim discharges the verbatim frame for every class untouched by a tier-1 merge, T5_merged_net_additive the unconditional clause-1 composition, T5_merged_ledger_is_positional_interleave the exact bounded impact on the mutate-free non-bridging fragment, and T5_merged_class_clauses_robust the clauses-2/3 composition under the honestly-stated running-nonnegativity + mutate-freeness side conditions, each proven necessary by a rejected witness (READ-at-0 interleave; merge-raised dynamic-COW sibling floor), over the T1 union-find redirect.
